      {
        "id": "K1",
        "text": "Cash flow amounts are stored with signed values: inflows (Deposit, SIP, Interest Credit, Tax Refund, Dividend Reinvestment, Lump Sum) are positive; outflows (Withdrawal, Redemption) are negative. Net cash flow is calculated as SUM(amount).",
        "fields": [
          {
            "table": "ATOM_EVENT_CASH_FLOW_001",
            "column": "amount"
          }
        ],
        "citations": [],
        "sources": [
          "domain",
          "rules"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "K2",
        "text": "For XIRR computation, apply the investor's-pocket transform: use -amount so that investment inflows become negative cash flows and current portfolio value/redemptions become positive. This is an explicit transformation for XIRR only; storage convention remains inflows positive, outflows negative.",
        "fields": [
          {
            "table": "ATOM_EVENT_CASH_FLOW_001",
            "column": "amount"
          }
        ],
        "citations": [],
        "sources": [
          "domain",
          "rules"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "K3",
        "text": "If computed XIRR exceeds 25%, flag as suspect and investigate data quality. Verify purchase_date, cost, and cash_flow records before using the figure.",
        "fields": [],
        "citations": [],
        "sources": [
          "domain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "K4",
        "text": "If computed XIRR is less than -50%, flag as suspect; likely due to missing recent valuation or stale current_value.",
        "fields": [],
        "citations": [],
        "sources": [
          "domain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "K5",
        "text": "If XIRR cannot be computed (e.g., no cash flows or all cash flows same-signed), return null; do not return an error-inflated number.",
        "fields": [],
        "citations": [],
        "sources": [
          "domain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "K6",
        "text": "Simple percentage return (returns_pct) is calculated as ((current_value - cost) / cost) * 100 and stored in portfolio_holding.returns_pct.",
        "fields": [
          {
            "table": "ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001",
            "column": "returns_pct"
          },
          {
            "table": "ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001",
            "column": "current_value"
          },
          {
            "table": "ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001",
            "column": "cost"
          }
        ],
        "citations": [],
        "sources": [
          "domain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "K7",
        "text": "Exclude holdings with returns_pct > 200% on holdings less than 1 year old from aggregations; flag for verification of purchase_date and cost.",
        "fields": [
          {
            "table": "ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001",
            "column": "returns_pct"
          },
          {
            "table": "ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001",
            "column": "purchase_date"
          }
        ],
        "citations": [],
        "sources": [
          "domain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "K8",
        "text": "Exclude holdings where returns_pct is negative but current_value > cost from aggregations; flag as data inconsistency.",
        "fields": [
          {
            "table": "ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001",
            "column": "returns_pct"
          },
          {
            "table": "ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001",
            "column": "current_value"
          },
          {
            "table": "ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001",
            "column": "cost"
          }
        ],
        "citations": [],
        "sources": [
          "domain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "K9",
        "text": "Exclude holdings where cost is 0 or NULL from return calculations; flag as incomplete data.",
        "fields": [
          {
            "table": "ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001",
            "column": "cost"
          }
        ],
        "citations": [],
        "sources": [
